{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate through claustrophobic tunnels and experiment rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> Restore power, decode locks, and piece together evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stealth and Survival:</strong> Avoid monstrous creatures and manage limited resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lore Discovery:</strong> Collect a few notes per map to unravel the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Environment:</strong> Flickering lights, eerie soundscapes, and oppressive darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Threats:</strong> Monsters with unique behaviors stalk the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Storytelling:</strong> Story revealed through environmental clues and collectible notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endgame Encounter:</strong> A dramatic showdown with the ultimate experiment deep within the shafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482760/extras/background1.png?t=1745975041\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482760?t=1745975041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482760?t=1745975041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482760/8262abfd52d74b1a8f15f4fb161c4713d38bcaae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745975041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482760/8262abfd52d74b1a8f15f4fb